  "body": "Termux:X11 (sharedUid variant) signed with the Pico Dev release certificate.\n\nWorks only with Pico Dev's termux shared UID APK (`PicoDev-termux-shared-*.apk`).\nIt runs inside Pico Dev's process, so Android does not slow down or kill the\nX server and desktop while you are looking at it.\n\nInstall:\n1. Install `Pico Dev-termux-x11-sharedUid.apk`.\n2. In Pico Dev's terminal: `pkg install x11-repo`, then\n   `dpkg -i Pico Dev-termux-x11-*-all.deb` (or `apt install ./Pico Dev-termux-x11-*-all.deb`).\n3. `pkg install xfce` and run `termux-x11 :0 -xstartup xfce4-session`.\n\nDo not install `termux-x11-nightly` from x11-repo: its loader only accepts the\nofficial Termux:X11 signature.\n\n- Version: v1.03.01\n- Built from commit: 3b7cc0a6258dbce483de4b20bc62161ad8ef3e87\n- SHA256 checksums: see `checksums-sha256.txt`\n"
